","topicLabel":"POTTERIES THINKBELT"},{"slug":"samantha-hardingham","name":"Samantha Hardingham","time":266.96,"topicId":"communications","topicLabel":"Communications"},{"slug":"steve-mullin","name":"Steve Mullin","time":350.88,"topicId":"potteries-thinkbelt","topicLabel":"POTTERIES THINKBELT"},{"slug":"thomas-weaver","name":"Thomas Weaver","time":575,"topicId":"institutions","topicLabel":"Institutions"},{"slug":"thomas-weaver","name":"Thomas Weaver","time":738.8,"topicId":"appearance","topicLabel":"Appearance"},{"slug":"will-alsop","name":"Will Alsop","time":498.32,"topicId":"institutions","topicLabel":"Institutions"},{"slug":"will-alsop","name":"Will Alsop","time":518.88,"topicId":"institutions","topicLabel":"Institutions"}]},"Archigram":{"slug":"archigram","body":"Archigram was an <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avant-garde\">avant-garde</a> architectural group formed in the 1960s - based at the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Architectural_Association_School_of_Architecture\">Architectural Association</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/London\">London</a> - that was <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neofuturistic\">neofuturistic</a>, anti-heroic and pro-consumerist, drawing inspiration from technology in order to create a new reality that was solely expressed through hypothetical projects. The main members of the group were <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Cook_(architect)\">Peter Cook</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Warren_Chalk&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">Warren Chalk</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ron_Herron\">Ron Herron</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Dennis_Crompton&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">Dennis Crompton</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Michael_Webb_(architect)\">Michael Webb</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=David_Greene_(architect)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\">David Greene</a>.","subtitle":"Peter Cook, Warren Chalk, Ron Herron, Dennis Crompton, Michael Webb and David Greene","image":"/cedric-price-memory-bank/cards/archigram.jpg","external":"http://designmuseum.org/design/archigram","location":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/36+Bedford+Square,+AA+School+of+Architecture,+Fitzrovia,+London+WC1B+3ES,+UK/@51.5183066,-0.1307022,17z","also":[{"slug":"bernard-tschumi","name":"Bernard Tschumi","time":770.36,"topicId":"scene","topicLabel":"Scene"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":344.88,"topicId":"generator","topicLabel":"GENERATOR"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":1125.6,"topicId":"potteries-thinkbelt","topicLabel":"POTTERIES THINKBELT"},{"slug":"john-frazer","name":"John Frazer","time":1192.04,"topicId":"potteries-thinkbelt","topicLabel":"POTTERIES THINKBELT"},{"slug":"thomas-weaver","name":"Thomas Weaver","time":644.08,"topicId":"institutions","topicLabel":"Institutions"},{"slug":"will-alsop","name":"Will Alsop","time":1356.68,"topicId":"conscience","topicLabel":"Conscience"}]}}}